/Title (border enforcement to a politically volatile nation lacking a unified central government or robust rule of law. Intercepted migrants were routinely returned to informal Libyan detention centers, facing documented human rights abuses, extortions, and unsafe conditions, drawing sharp condemnation from UN agencies including the UNHCR and UNHRC. Next time, external interception assistance must be strictly conditional upon verified adherence to)
/Dest [35 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
